glimpse-media-viewer (1.0.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * Show the files as a grid of thumbnails, with a slider, zoom buttons and
    Ctrl+scroll to change their size.
  * Open camera RAW files (Canon, Nikon, Sony, DNG, Fujifilm, Olympus,
    Panasonic, Pentax, Samsung, Minolta) by their embedded preview.
  * Play more video formats (VOB, MPE, M2V, ASF, DivX, Xvid, F4V, 3G2, OGM,
    RealMedia, DV, MXF and more) and music formats (M4B audiobooks, MP2, APE,
    Musepack, True Audio, DSD, AC-3, DTS, Speex and more).
  * Recommend gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, for MPEG, AVCHD and MXF files.
  * Widen the window when it opens if the sidebar, picture and second folder
    don't fit, so the close button is never cut off.

 -- Salvatore Turone <turone@hotmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:24:40 +0100

